# OpenAPI schema details

Companion to `swagger-api-docs.mdc`. Every API endpoint must show in Swagger `/docs`.

## Schemas

- `Field(description=...)` on every public attribute
- Examples via `json_schema_extra` and/or route `Body(openapi_examples=...)`
- Validation rules (`min_length`, `ge`, …) must match runtime behavior

## Tags

- Register tags in `app.main.OPENAPI_TAGS` before using them on routes

## Do not

- Bare `dict` JSON responses when a Pydantic model exists
- Spanish OpenAPI text
